stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IDLE
    IDLE --> AUTO_RUN: A key down
    AUTO_RUN --> IDLE: elapsed >= 5 seconds / restore scale
    AUTO_RUN --> RUN: Left or Right key down / force pressed direction
    AUTO_RUN --> AUTO_RUN: screen edge / reverse direction
    IDLE --> WALK: arrow without Shift
    IDLE --> RUN: Shift + arrow
    WALK --> RUN: Shift down with arrow held
    RUN --> WALK: Shift up with arrow held
    WALK --> IDLE: no net arrow direction
    RUN --> IDLE: no net arrow direction
    IDLE --> SLEEP: idle >= 5 seconds
    SLEEP --> IDLE: Space then wake rotation completes
    SLEEP --> WALK: arrow / cancel sleep rotation
    note right of AUTO_RUN
        states/auto_run.py: class AutoRun
        800 px/s, scale 1.5
        Run cancellation needs no Shift
        A repeat does not reset timer inside AutoRun
    end note
    note left of IDLE
        Reset idle timer on every entry
    end note
